soto.podaac.earthdatacloud.nasa.gov/hydrocron/v1/timeseries?collection_name=SWOT_L2_HR_RiverSP_2.0&amp;feature=Reach&amp;feature_id=18180900091&amp;start_time=2025-04-01T00:00:00%2b00:00&amp;end_time=2025-10-30T00:00:00%2b00:00&amp;output=geojson&amp;fields=reach_id,time_str,wse,sos_consensus_q,sos_hivdi_q,sos_metroman_q,sos_momma_q,sos_sad_q,sos_sic4dvar_q,sos_lakeflow_q,swot_discharge_reanalysis" class="link whitespace-nowrap"><span class="link-text whitespace-normal">https://<wbr/>soto<wbr/>.podaac<wbr/>.earthdatacloud<wbr/>.nasa<wbr/>.gov<wbr/>/hydrocron<wbr/>/v1<wbr/>/timeseries<wbr/>?collection<wbr/>_name<wbr/>=<wbr/>SWOT<wbr/>_L2<wbr/>_HR<wbr/>_RiverSP<wbr/>_2<wbr/>.0<wbr/>&amp;<wbr/>feature<wbr/>=<wbr/>Reach<wbr/>&amp;<wbr/>feature<wbr/>_id<wbr/>=<wbr/>18180900091<wbr/>&amp;<wbr/>start<wbr/>_time<wbr/>=<wbr/>2025<wbr/>-04<wbr/>-01T00:00:00<wbr/>%2b00:00<wbr/>&amp;<wbr/>end<wbr/>_time<wbr/>=<wbr/>2025<wbr/>-10<wbr/>-30T00:00:00<wbr/>%2b00:00<wbr/>&amp;<wbr/>output<wbr/>=<wbr/>geojson<wbr/>&amp;<wbr/>fields<wbr/>=<wbr/>reach<wbr/>_id<wbr/>,time<wbr/>_str<wbr/>,wse<wbr/>,sos<wbr/>_consensus<wbr/>_q<wbr/>,sos<wbr/>_hivdi<wbr/>_q<wbr/>,sos<wbr/>_metroman<wbr/>_q<wbr/>,sos<wbr/>_momma<wbr/>_q<wbr/>,sos<wbr/>_sad<wbr/>_q<wbr/>,sos<wbr/>_sic4dvar<wbr/>_q<wbr/>,sos<wbr/>_lakeflow<wbr/>_q<wbr/>,swot<wbr/>_discharge<wbr/>_reanalysis</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="link-icon"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 6H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 3 8.25v10.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 5.25 21h10.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 18 18.75V10.5m-10.5 6L21 3m0 0h-5.25M21 3v5.25"></path></svg></a></p><p>Will return GeoJSON:</p><div class="relative myst-code group not-prose my-5 text-sm shadow hover:shadow-md dark:shadow-2xl dark:shadow-neutral-900 bg-stone-200/10"><div aria-label="code block content" class="block overflow-auto p-3 myst-code-body hljs"><pre sty